	(text_box "The WS2812B-4020-V6 that I'm using doesn't need level shifting.\nThe datasheet sats that anything between 0.55*VDD and VDD+0.7\ncounts as a high signal, so a 5V WS2812B can be driven by 2.8V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 13.97 0)
